      "message": "Hi google friends, this patch is to fix below CTS cases on low-performance devices.\nCtsInputMethodTestCases android.view.inputmethod.cts.StylusHandwritingTest#testHandwriting_delegateFromHomePackage CtsInputMethodTestCases android.view.inputmethod.cts.StylusHandwritingTest#testHandwriting_delegateToDifferentPackage\n\nAbove 2 CTS cases failed on low-performance devices due to handwriting session\nbeing early terminated on low-performance, so this patch adjusts the HANDWRITING_DELEGATION_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS based on the board \"ro.hw_timeout_multiplier\" property, giving low-performance devices sufficient time to complete the handwriting delegation process and avoid premature cleanup.",
